raycast-litellm
===============

This extension's user-interface layer and prompt definitions are derived from
the "Ollama AI" Raycast extension (`raycast-ollama`), used under the MIT
License.

    Upstream:  https://github.com/raycast/extensions/tree/74199253f634a755c4526bfdc98779d10d7253f9/extensions/raycast-ollama
    Commit:    74199253f634a755c4526bfdc98779d10d7253f9
    Author:    Massimiliano Pasquini
    License:   MIT

Specifically derived from upstream:

  - the answer/chat view structure under `src/lib/ui/`
  - the prompt wording for the text-transformation commands
  - the input-acquisition behaviour (selected text with clipboard fallback)

Written independently for this project:

  - the entire LiteLLM API client (`src/lib/litellm/`), which targets an
    OpenAI-compatible proxy rather than a local Ollama daemon
  - model discovery, health/error mapping, and reasoning-stream handling

The upstream MIT license text is reproduced in LICENSE, which also covers this
project's own code.
